OL,3,AFamily pays tribute to 'warm and
OL,4,Aengaging' man killed in tiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it was for the coroner to
OL,7,Fdecide whether his mental illness
OL,8,Fplayed a part in his death, asking that
OL,9,Fthe public respect that process.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
